      "en": "**web scraping** = collecting data from web pages with code. Before you start: is there an API, an RSS feed or an official export? Use it. Read the **terms of service**. Do not collect **personal data** (people’s names and phones) without a legal basis. Go easy on the site (one request every two seconds, not 100 per second). Identify yourself with a User-Agent containing an email."
