      "en": "Sites change. Choose selectors by meaning (`[itemprop=price]`, `[data-sku]`, clearly named headings and classes), not by position (`div:nth-child(3)`). And check the result: if there are 0 products or every price is NaN — the design changed; throw and alert instead of saving empty data."
